  "abstract": "Gamma schedule sweep at the current best capacity: increase gamma_end to 0.99 to emphasize factor contribution at later horizons. Uses oscillatory 2nd-order SSM factors, factorized loadings (k=320, p=32), residual copy head, MAE+curvature loss, and V-orthogonality (\u03bb=1e-5).",
